    console.log("🤖 Q&A item", i + 1, "explanationBox:", !!explanationBox);
    if (!explanationBox) continue;

    try {
      explanationBox.textContent = "⏳ Generating AI explanation...";

      const prompt = `
You are SASIKUMAR AI, a careful school Education Tutor.

Explain the following practice question for a ${item.className} student.

Class: ${item.className}
Subject: ${item.subject}
Medium: ${item.medium}
Question: ${item.question}
Given Answer: ${item.answer}

STRICT EDUCATIONAL ACCURACY RULES:
1. Give Tamil explanation first, followed by simple English.
2. Use natural, standard school-level Tamil. Do not invent Tamil words.
3. Keep established English scientific/mathematical terms in brackets when useful, for example: குளோரோபில் (chlorophyll), குளோரோபிளாஸ்ட் (chloroplast), குளுக்கோஸ் (glucose).
